  "name": "Venomous Bite",
  "type": "feature",
  "system": {
    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to make an attack against a PC within Melee range. On a success, deal <strong>4d4+4</strong> physical damage and Poison the target until they succeed on a Strength Roll (20). While Poisoned, the target must roll a <strong>d6</strong> before they make an action roll. On a result of 4 or lower, the target must mark a Stress.</p>",
